==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Legends Awakened|Piloswine|69}} from the {{TCG|Legends Awakened}} expansion.
*'''Headbutt Bounce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Wobbuffet|58}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

